{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03757","headline":"南海乱石山作 · 杜审言","name":"南海乱石山作","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"涨海积稽天，羣山高嶪地。\n相传称乱石，图典失其事。\n悬危悉可惊，大小都不类。\n乍将云岛极，还与星河次。\n上耸忽如飞，下临仍欲坠。\n朝暾赩丹紫，夜魄炯青翠。\n穹崇雾雨蓄，幽隐灵仙閟。\n万寻挂鹤巢，千丈垂猿臂。\n昔去景风涉，今来姑洗至。\n观此得咏歌，长时想精异。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杜审言","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_03757.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03757","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}